  "convention_notes": [
    "Fixed names are names recognized or documented by their respective tools; an exemption does not require a repository to contain them.",
    "README and license names are recognized repository-documentation conventions, not language mandates.",
    "The test layout values are harness defaults, not tool requirements.",
    "Lockfile and tool-config names are the names each tool reads or writes; listing one never requires a repository to use that tool."
  ],
